    "api_error_status": null,
    "result": "`invoice_totals` is implemented in `solution.py`, and the 17 tests in `tests/test_solution.py` pass with `python -m pytest -q tests`. I didn't run a coverage check, so the 90% line-coverage gate is unverified. The tests do exercise every branch I wrote.\n\nThe code follows `spec.md`:\n- **Validation:** it checks region, category, `qty` (no bools), price, discount and credit, and raises `ValueError` on any violation.\n- **Line amounts:** the net is rounded per line, with the 5% bulk discount multiplied on top of the line's own discount. Tax is then rounded per line from the rounded net.\n- **Totals and credit:** the totals are sums of the line values. Credit is capped at gross.\n- **`tax_by_rate`:** it includes a rate-0 entry when a food line appears in region A.\n\nThe tests cover:\n- an empty invoice;\n- regions A and B;\n- the 10% plus 5% case giving 85.50;\n- bulk-discount boundaries;\n- half-up rounding;\n- partial and full credit;\n- each validation error;\n- discounts of exactly 0 and 100.",
